3
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.900
And this kind of car hacking really started a very long time ago.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.900
It started with people who wanted to modify

5
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.900
the way their vehicles worked.

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.900
They wanted to either improve fuel performance

7
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.900
