9
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.900
A lot of hobbyist people started hacking their cars back in the day

10
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.900
because they wanted to get more personalized experiences

11
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.900
or get specific functionality that maybe the manufacturer had unlocked

12
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.900
