13
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.900
And what they would do is they would actually try

14
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.900
and reverse engineer the firmware running on these ECUs.

15
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.900
They would modify them to be able to do other functions.

16
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.900
And then they would reflash them to the car.

17
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:45.900
We would call this chip tuning.

18
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.900
It's a huge community of people who do chip tuning

19
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.900
