26
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.900
These heavy-duty diesel trucks,

27
00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:13.900
they have a lot of emissions control regulations

28
00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.900
and rules you have to follow.

29
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.900
You have to fill a separate tank.

30
00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.900
You have your gas tank for your truck.

31
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.900
You also have a tank of a fluid called DEF.

32
00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.900
And what it's used for is it's sprayed into your exhaust system

33
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.900
to actually provide a chemical reaction with the exhaust,

34
00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:34.900
the nitrous oxide coming out of your car or your truck.

35
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.900
And it reduces the harm that you do to the atmosphere and the environment.

36
00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:40.900
And so legally, your truck is not allowed to drive

37
00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.900
