hey, just remove your aftermarket control module.

45
00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:06.900
It's ACM.

46
00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.900
It's the part of the truck that's in charge of this.

47
00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:09.900
Mail it to us.

48
00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.900
We will change the firmware on there.

49
00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:16.900
So it doesn't require that kind of ACM from Argentina.

